Depends: bash
Description: Universal Linux update tool
 Cross-distribution update utility supporting apt,
 dnf and zypper package managers.
 Designed for Ubuntu, kali-linux
 Debian, eLxr , openSUSE, fendora,
 Oracle Linux , AlmaLinux ,Rocky Linux Plus 9.

